WEBVTT

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.021
There's something in this water here that's happening right

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:21.570
now that's really exciting. When there's a great

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:24.587
technological advances, a lot of times the small business

00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:27.960
owners or entrepreneurs, they get left behind.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.030
What I love about this workshop the most is not just the

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:34.047
tools that we learn, but what it means for Baton Rouge.

00:00:34.047 --> 00:00:37.118
Drop the technology for a moment. This has nothing to do

00:00:37.118 --> 00:00:40.189
with technology. This is all to do with your mindset. We

00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:43.421
are having a tedious invoicing issue. Takes our human three

00:00:43.421 --> 00:00:46.384
days to do it. If we build it right, it'll be a cup of

00:00:46.384 --> 00:00:49.617
coffee. We're calling it from three days to a cup of coffee.

00:00:49.617 --> 00:00:52.903
It's really great to have a wonderful workshop like this to

00:00:52.903 --> 00:00:55.543
ground me in knowledge that can help me to do it

00:00:55.543 --> 00:00:57.960
efficiently and to continue doing the work.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:01.186
Hello. It's one thing to say, well, maybe I can just figure

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:04.359
it out on my own, but it's really great to have the people

00:01:04.359 --> 00:01:08.530
behind the thing to help you learn that they.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.329
How do we strip away the tasks so we can do more of this

00:01:11.329 --> 00:01:15.540
human to human? That's where the magic lives.